<title>LATVIA: Latvian 1996 unemployment rose to 7.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Latvian 1996 unemployment rose to 7.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia's unemployment rose to 7.2 percent at end-1996 from 6.6 percent at the end of 1995, the statistics committee said in a statement.</p>
<p> LATVIAN UNEMPLOYMENT     Dec '96    Nov '96    Dec '95</p>
<p> Unemployment rate (pct)  7.2	  7.1	  6.6</p>
<p> Number of unemployed     90,800     90,100     83,200</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
